{"seq":7,"slug":"analog-circuit-design","title":"模拟电路设计","stage":"DONE","category":"hardware-electronics","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/analog-circuit-design","rating":{"composite":4.16,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 模拟电路设计 简介\n\n模拟电路设计研究连续信号世界里的电路分析与设计。与处理离散电平、只关心「0 与 1」的数字电路不同，模拟电路面对的是随时间连续变化的电压与电流：传感器输出的微弱信号、音频与射频波形、电源里的纹波、温度与压力的物理量。现实世界本质上是模拟的，任何系统在采样进入数字域之前、或在数字处理之后驱动物理负载时，都离不开一段模拟前端或后端。这正是模拟电路设计长期不可替代的原因。\n\n这个 hub 面向电子工程学习者，目标是建立从器件特性到完整模拟系统的设计直觉与分析能力。它聚焦连续信号链路上的核心问题——增益、带宽、噪声、失真、阻抗匹配、偏置与稳定性，而把同分类下的其它主题留给各自的 hub：数字电路讲逻辑与时序，功率电子讲能量变换与开关，信号完整性讲高速互连与传输线效应。读这里，你关心的是如何让一个微弱、连续、易受干扰的信号被准确地放大、滤波与传递。\n\n整个 hub 按由浅入深的四章展开。第一章「模拟电路基础」打底，梳理无源元件、二极管与晶体管的工作区、直流偏置与小信号模型，以及频率响应、噪声与反馈等贯穿全程的基本概念。第二章「放大器设计」进入主线，从单级共射、共源到多级级联，讨论增益分配、带宽、输入输出阻抗与差分对，把器件知识转化为可指标化的放大器。第三章「运放与模拟模块」上升到模块层次，以运算放大器为核心，扩展到滤波器、比较器、基准源、振荡器与数据转换器接口等可复用的功能块，学习用成熟模块快速搭建信号链。第四章「实践与可靠性」收束于工程落地，关注布局布线、电源去耦、温漂与失调、电磁兼容与裕量设计，让纸面电路在真实环境中稳定可靠地工作。\n\n四章之间是一条清晰的脉络：从理解单个器件，到设计单元电路，再到组合功能模块，最后让系统在现实约束下可靠运行。学完之后，你应当能读懂一张模拟原理图背后的设计取舍，并独立完成一条从输入到输出、指标可控的模拟信号链设计。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"analog-fundamentals","title":"模拟电路基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/analog-circuit-design/analog-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"circuit-analysis-fundamentals","title":"电路分析基础 — Circuit Analysis Fundamentals","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/analog-circuit-design/analog-fundamentals/circuit-analysis-fundamentals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"semiconductor-devices","title":"半导体器件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/analog-circuit-design/analog-fundamentals/semiconductor-devices"},{"seq":3,"slug":"small-signal-models","title":"小信号模型：把非线性器件在工作点附近拉直成可手算的线性网络","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/analog-circuit-design/analog-fundamentals/small-signal-models"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"amplifier-design","title":"放大器设计","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/analog-circuit-design/amplifier-design","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"single-stage-amplifiers","title":"单级放大器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/analog-circuit-design/amplifier-design/single-stage-amplifiers"},{"seq":2,"slug":"differential-and-multistage","title":"差分与多级放大器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/analog-circuit-design/amplifier-design/differential-and-multistage"},{"seq":3,"slug":"frequency-response-and-feedback","title":"频率响应与负反馈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/analog-circuit-design/amplifier-design/frequency-response-and-feedback"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"opamps-and-building-blocks","title":"运放与模拟模块","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/analog-circuit-design/opamps-and-building-blocks","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"operational-amplifiers","title":"运算放大器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/analog-circuit-design/opamps-and-building-blocks/operational-amplifiers"},{"seq":2,"slug":"filters-and-oscillators","title":"滤波器与振荡器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/analog-circuit-design/opamps-and-building-blocks/filters-and-oscillators"},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-converters-adc-dac","title":"数据转换器 ADC 与 DAC","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/analog-circuit-design/opamps-and-building-blocks/data-converters-adc-dac"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice-and-reliability","title":"实践与可靠性","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/analog-circuit-design/practice-and-reliability","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"noise-and-distortion","title":"噪声与失真","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/analog-circuit-design/practice-and-reliability/noise-and-distortion"},{"seq":2,"slug":"analog-layout-and-pcb","title":"模拟版图与 PCB","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/analog-circuit-design/practice-and-reliability/analog-layout-and-pcb"},{"seq":3,"slug":"power-management-and-references","title":"电源管理与基准电压","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/analog-circuit-design/practice-and-reliability/power-management-and-references"}]}]}